{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-jsx","path":"/fetch/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"mythofsummer"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"78b85186-075a-5343-a665-9592e3f2d8db","excerpt":"안녕하세요😊 이번 글에서는 프로젝트를 진행하며 N+1 문제를 해결하여 성능을 최적화 한 과정에 대해 작성해보려고 합니다. N+1 문제란? N+1 문제는 JPA와 같은 ORM을 사용할 때 발생하는 성능 문제 중 하나로, 연관된 엔티티를 조회할 때 추가 쿼리가 반복적으로 발생하여 성능이 저하되는 현상을 말합니다. 즉시 로딩 (FetchType.EAGER) 사…","html":"<p>안녕하세요😊 이번 글에서는 프로젝트를 진행하며 N+1 문제를 해결하여 성능을 최적화 한 과정에 대해 작성해보려고 합니다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"N1-문제란\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#N1-%EB%AC%B8%EC%A0%9C%EB%9E%80\" aria-label=\"N1 문제란 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>N+1 문제란?</h2>\n<p>N+1 문제는 JPA와 같은 ORM을 사용할 때 발생하는 성능 문제 중 하나로, 연관된 엔티티를 조회할 때 추가 쿼리가 반복적으로 발생하여 성능이 저하되는 현상을 말합니다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"즉시-로딩-FetchTypeEAGER-사용-시-문제\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%A6%89%EC%8B%9C-%EB%A1%9C%EB%94%A9-FetchTypeEAGER-%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9-%EC%8B%9C-%EB%AC%B8%EC%A0%9C\" aria-label=\"즉시 로딩 FetchTypeEAGER 사용 시 문제 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>즉시 로딩 (FetchType.EAGER) 사용 시 문제</h2>\n<p>즉시 로딩은 연관된 엔티티를 즉시 조회하는 방식입니다. 다음 예제를 보겠습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Entity</span>\n<span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Table</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"log\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Log</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Id</span>\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@GeneratedValue</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>strategy <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">GenerationType</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token constant\">IDENTITY</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Column</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"log_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> updatable <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">false</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Long</span> id<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Column</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"text\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> text<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@JsonIgnore</span>\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@ManyToOne</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>fetch <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">FetchType</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token constant\">EAGER</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@JoinColumn</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"user_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">User</span> user<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>이 상태에서 Log 데이터를 조회하는 다음 코드가 실행된다고 가정합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\">entityManager<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">createQuery</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"select l from log l\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>실행되는 쿼리</strong></p>\n<p>그러면 log 테이블의 데이터를 가져오는 메인 쿼리가 발생합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sql\"><pre class=\"language-sql\"><code class=\"language-sql\"><span class=\"token keyword\">SELECT</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">FROM</span> log<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>그 다음, log와 연관된 user를 즉시 로딩으로 바로 가져와야된다는 것을 알고 user를 가져오는 추가 쿼리를 또 날리게 됩니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sql\"><pre class=\"language-sql\"><code class=\"language-sql\"><span class=\"token keyword\">SELECT</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">FROM</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">user</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">WHERE</span> user_id <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> ?<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">-- 각 Log의 user_id에 대해 실행</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"N1-문제-발생\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#N1-%EB%AC%B8%EC%A0%9C-%EB%B0%9C%EC%83%9D\" aria-label=\"N1 문제 발생 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>N+1 문제 발생</h3>\n<p>결국, Log 엔티티가 100개라면, 로그 데이터를 가져오는 1개의 쿼리 + 100개의 User 데이터를 가져오는 쿼리가 실행됩니다. (총 101개의 쿼리 발생)\n심지어 User가 필요하지 않은 상황이라고 하더라고 Log를 가져올 때는 무조건 추가로 N개의 쿼리가 발생하게 되어 성능이 심각하게 저하됩니다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"지연-로딩-FetchTypeLAZY-사용-시-변화\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%A7%80%EC%97%B0-%EB%A1%9C%EB%94%A9-FetchTypeLAZY-%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9-%EC%8B%9C-%EB%B3%80%ED%99%94\" aria-label=\"지연 로딩 FetchTypeLAZY 사용 시 변화 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>지연 로딩 (FetchType.LAZY) 사용 시 변화</h2>\n<p>지연 로딩은 연관된 엔티티를 실제로 접근할 때 쿼리를 실행합니다.\n다음과 같이 지연 로딩을 설정합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Entity</span>\n<span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Table</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"log\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Log</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Id</span>\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@GeneratedValue</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>strategy <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">GenerationType</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token constant\">IDENTITY</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Column</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"log_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> updatable <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">false</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Long</span> id<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Column</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"text\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> text<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@JsonIgnore</span>\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@ManyToOne</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>fetch <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">FetchType</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token constant\">LAZY</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@JoinColumn</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"user_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">User</span> user<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>실행되는 쿼리</strong></p>\n<p>이제 Log 데이터를 조회하면 다음과 같은 메인 쿼리가 실행됩니다. 이 메인 쿼리는 log 테이블의 데이터만 조회합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sql\"><pre class=\"language-sql\"><code class=\"language-sql\"><span class=\"token keyword\">SELECT</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">FROM</span> log<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>하지만 다음과 같이 User에 접근할 때 여전히 추가 쿼리가 발생합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">Log</span> log <span class=\"token operator\">:</span> logs<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token class-name\">System</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>out<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">println</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>log<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getUser</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getName</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sql\"><pre class=\"language-sql\"><code class=\"language-sql\"><span class=\"token keyword\">SELECT</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">FROM</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">user</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">WHERE</span> user_id <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> ?<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"여전히-발생하는-N1-문제\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%97%AC%EC%A0%84%ED%9E%88-%EB%B0%9C%EC%83%9D%ED%95%98%EB%8A%94-N1-%EB%AC%B8%EC%A0%9C\" aria-label=\"여전히 발생하는 N1 문제 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>여전히 발생하는 N+1 문제</h3>\n<p>Log가 100개라면, User에 접근할 때마다 추가 쿼리가 실행되므로 총 100개의 추가 쿼리가 발생합니다. 즉, 지연 로딩만으로는 N+1 문제를 완전히 해결하지 못합니다.\n결국, 즉시 로딩과 비교했을 때, 불필요한 로딩을 방지하기는 하나 상황에 따라 문제가 발생할 수 있게 됩니다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"Fetch-Join으로-N1-문제-해결\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Fetch-Join%EC%9C%BC%EB%A1%9C-N1-%EB%AC%B8%EC%A0%9C-%ED%95%B4%EA%B2%B0\" aria-label=\"Fetch Join으로 N1 문제 해결 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>Fetch Join으로 N+1 문제 해결</h2>\n<p>Fetch Join은 JPA에서 제공하는 강력한 기능으로, 연관된 엔티티를 한 번의 쿼리로 조인하여 가져옵니다. 이를 통해 N+1 문제를 효과적으로 해결할 수 있습니다.</p>\n<p><strong>Fetch Join 적용</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token class-name\">List</span><span class=\"token generics\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token class-name\">Log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span> logs <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> entityManager<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">createQuery</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"select l from Log l join fetch l.user\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getResultList</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>실행되는 쿼리</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sql\"><pre class=\"language-sql\"><code class=\"language-sql\"><span class=\"token keyword\">SELECT</span> l<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token operator\">*</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> u<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">FROM</span> log l <span class=\"token keyword\">JOIN</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">user</span> u <span class=\"token keyword\">ON</span> l<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>user_id <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> u<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>user_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>Fetch Join을 적용했더니 Log와 연관된 User 데이터를 조인하여 한 번에 가져올 수 있게 되었습니다.\n다음 방법으로 필요한 데이터만 효율적으로 가져올 수 있었고, 쿼리 실행 횟수를 줄여 성능을 대폭 개선할 수 있었습니다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"실제-프로젝트에-적용\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%8B%A4%EC%A0%9C-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%A0%9D%ED%8A%B8%EC%97%90-%EC%A0%81%EC%9A%A9\" aria-label=\"실제 프로젝트에 적용 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>실제 프로젝트에 적용</h2>\n<p>실제 프로젝트에서 log를 가져오는 부분에 적용하여 성능을 최적화 했던 예를 보여드리겠습니다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"문제-상황\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%AC%B8%EC%A0%9C-%EC%83%81%ED%99%A9\" aria-label=\"문제 상황 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>문제 상황</h3>\n<p>기존 코드에서는 Log 엔티티와 연관된 데이터(User, Place, LogImages)를 조회할 때 N+1 문제가 발생했습니다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"최적화된-코드\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%B5%9C%EC%A0%81%ED%99%94%EB%90%9C-%EC%BD%94%EB%93%9C\" aria-label=\"최적화된 코드 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>최적화된 코드</h3>\n<p>Fetch Join을 적용하여 N+1 문제를 해결한 코드입니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Override</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Optional</span><span class=\"token generics\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token class-name\">List</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token class-name\">Log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span> <span class=\"token function\">findLogsByUserId</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">Long</span> userId<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> queryStr <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"SELECT DISTINCT l FROM Log l \"</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"JOIN FETCH l.user u \"</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"JOIN FETCH l.place p \"</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"LEFT JOIN FETCH l.logImages li \"</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"WHERE l.user.id = :userId \"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n        <span class=\"token class-name\">TypedQuery</span><span class=\"token generics\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token class-name\">Log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span> query <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> em<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">createQuery</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>queryStr<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n        query<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">setParameter</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"userId\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> userId<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n        <span class=\"token class-name\">List</span><span class=\"token generics\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token class-name\">Log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span> resultList <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getResultList</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> resultList<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">isEmpty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">?</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Optional</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">empty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Optional</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span cla